# M10 "Ganimet", flow "loot_warden" run 2: the level-10 warrior of run 1 (vo_admin set-level, test
# database only) kills the elite Kor Bekçisi. Its bag always holds Akçe and a rare Kor Çekirdeği (blue
# name), maybe a shield / sword / staff: a multi-row loot window with a rare item and its tooltip,
# then take-all into the inventory.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m10_warden
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+coinsknown+monsters 1800
expect world+level10+fullhp
scene expectcoins = 0
wait 120
scene walktomonster Kor Bekçisi 13
waitfor world+nodest+standing 3600
scene target nearest Kor Bekçisi
key f
waitfor world+attacking+ownhits1 900
waitfor world+skillready 400
key 1
waitfor world+kills1 3600
expect world+alive
waitfor world+lootvisible+lootmine 300
scene lootlog
key escape
wait 60
scene camera front 30 6
wait 5
screenshot 01_warden_bag.png
key e
waitfor world+lootwin+lootcontents 600
expecttext loot.contents Kor Çekirdeği
expecttext loot.contents Akçe
scene lootlog
hoveron loot.entry.0
wait 5
screenshot 02_warden_loot_rare.png
key i
waitfor world+inv 60
key e
waitfor world+coingains1+lootidle 600
waitfor world+lootwinclosed+noloot 600
scene expectcoins >= 120
scene expectitem 11 >= 1
wait 4
screenshot 03_warden_taken.png
scene lootlog
quit
